CODE WRITING & STRUCTURAL RULES (HIGHEST PRIORITY)
============================================================

0. Repository / Service Transaction Boundary (CRITICAL):

- Repository methods MUST NOT call commit or rollback
- Service layer is the ONLY transaction boundary

1. Imports:

- from app.extensions import db  
- from app.models.<entity_snake_case> import <EntityName>  
- from app.repositories.<entity_snake_case>_repository import <EntityName>Repository  
